Pipe through jq. `curl -s https://api.example.com/users | jq .` formats JSON output indented. Extract specific fields: `curl -s <url> | jq '.users[].email'`. Show just HTTP status + body: `curl -s -w "

HTTP: %{http_code}
" <url>`. Combined check + parse: `curl -fsSL <url> | jq .` (the `-f` fails on HTTP 4xx/5xx, `-s` silent, `-S` show errors).

